    "turn_idx": 51,
    "turn_text": "I find that's a sign of maturity too. I know I sense it in myself sometimes when I am advocating a position or suggesting something or looking into something a certain way. And I realize I'm doing it from an emotional perspective or I'm doing it for this is how I want things to be,",
